      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The resident legendary chef, who judges the culinary contest that is the
    main event of the food festival happening in town. He''s a town resident and
    is universally famous on the island (and beyond) for his cooking expertise, to
    the point where he even got a statue of himself in the main square.



    His
    real name is Crug, but everybody calls him "Comb". This nickname comes from the
    idea that he is used to source his ingredients himself by combing the area for
    the absolute best ones, no matter how dangerous that is. Him and Hamlet, the
    pig chef are pretty similar in how reckless they are when it comes to cooking
    ingredients (except for the fact that Chef Comb lost an ear while doing so).'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
