      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This dish shows that the player took the initiative to come up with new
    ingredients and make a truly original dish, despite the trend that everyone else
    seemed to follow. Both doughs, the one with the Glucose egg and the other with
    the Golden Egg lead to the winning dish, however together with the whole story
    and background of the festival, depending on what the players chose to put in
    we can have 2 different endings:'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
