      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "THE SECRET NEW \"HOT TWIST\" EVERYONE IS TALKING ABOUT\n\tA \"hot\" new
    twist being \"secretly\" discussed to make the dishes even spicier, that all
    natives seem to endorse. \n\tThis twist is a new recipe from Felfel, the community's
    beloved Saucier, whom Hamlet eventually meets.\n\nDialogue: The players can overhear
    discussions of locals talking about this new \"thing\", but who quickly change
    the subject when Hamlet approaches as if it is a well-kept secret."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
