  m_text: Felfel sells some of the finest spices he collects himself, who also uses
    them to make spectacular sauces that elevate any dish flavor. Like Hamlet, he
    used to travel a lot and has come up with some exceptional recipes. On a hard
    and busy day that Hamlet helps him find some pepper he has run out of, he gratefully
    shares a new spicy sauce recipe that he believes he could make Hamlet's dish
    win. Since it's one of his latest inventions, he is eager to see its application
    on other's dishes and add another winning contest dish with his signature on
    his achievements.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
