  m_text: 'Depending on how the players will approach the preparation of the final
    dish, we decided to add some feedback:  as will Comb, the Legendary Chef judge
    Hamlet''s dish, so are we, the developers, going to judge the players gameplay!
    This is merely implemented as a humorous addition in the form of Achievements
    that could be unlocked and exposed on Steam.'
