      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This is a young specimen of a phoenix, the mythological bird which can
    control fire. Hamlet, the pig chef found it in one of his adventures, and since
    then the chick happily follows him nesting inside a portable lantern.



    Although
    young, this chick can conjure powerful flames just like a regular phoenix and
    potentially burn anything to ashes. But due to its pacific nature it usually
    limits itself to provide fire for improvised campfires in exchange of a bit of
    food (it doesn''t eat much).'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
