  m_text: 'A good story always has a meaningful takeaway and even in this vertical
    slice  there is plenty of room to make a point. So what could that be?

    We
    decided that since the Cooking Festival is basically a contest, we wanted to
    let players try out their own ways of winning by giving away several "carrots"
    as well as distractions.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
