  m_text: "\tPresenting the Lobster Soup means that the players have either copied
    or stolen the recipe from the favorite contestant. Whether it is the exact original
    or a variation of it with the addition of the Spicy Sauce does not make much
    difference, apart from a poor attempt to present the dish as \"unique\"."
