  m_text: "01. Download Hamlet's fbx \n02. Download Nar's (Phoenix Chick) fbx \n03.
    Download Boat fbx \n04. Upload finished .fbx file with animation clip on the
    Community Shared GoogleDrive Folder (URL1)\n05. Also upload on a personal GoogleDrive
    link (URL2) as a proof of ownership and backup file\n06. Post:\n- Finished task
    video outcome (gif or video) \n- URL1 + URL2\n in the Animation Forum thread"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
