  m_text: 'Meals can:

    1. Restore health

    2. Serve as quest steps in order
    to form bonds with the recipient and exchange favors or information

    3. Become
    an essential part of important social gatherings that strengthens the community
    bonds, re-discover its uniqueness and connects it/shares it with the rest of
    the world (the Cooking Festival)'
