  m_text: 'This dish shows that the player took the initiative to enhance a recipe
    with another one, creating something new.

    Even though mixing and experimenting
    are actions that lead to the winning dish, this dish will fail because the player
    combined other people''s signature dishes instead of making up their own. Plus,
    it adds to the pile of spicy dishes presented in the contest not really making
    much difference.

'
