  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "      - Cooking is survival: biological, social, cultural\n\t1. Meals
    keep us alive\n\t2. Shared meals serve as bonding mechanisms between individuals
    that evoked altruistic behaviors equally necessary for survival. \n\t3. On a
    societal scale, cooking validates the existence of different cultures which brings
    us to the next key point:\n\n- Cooking can reflect and form identities:\n\tOn
    a personal level: It brings up memories, shaping unique, personal experiences
    triggered with certain tastes and smells\n\tOn a collective level: It carries
    on tradition, shaping collective memories of communities connecting with their
    roots\n\n- Cooking is all about creativity, originality and surprise\n \tExperimentation
    can bring innovation and new ideas on the table, finding out new recipe variations,
    new combinations, new tastes and flavors that result in new dishes/ new identities.\n\n-
    Cooking creates the sense of achievement and reward\n\tWhether it is about gathering
    all the ingredients, following the steps of a recipe correctly or figuring out
    a new recipe on your own, preparing a successful dish is an achievement on its
    own right, the reward being the very act of eating it or -even more so- sharing
    it!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
