      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\tPlayers getting a lot of information about the great taste the Golden
    Eggs used to have before they went extinct, which is why the Cooking Festival
    is being hosted in the first place -> to find new tastes that will elevate the
    local cuisine again. \n\tFinding and cooking one will definitely make the dish
    supreme, but it will absolutely fail both the spirit of the contest as well as
    the locals."
