  m_text: 'Our protagonist has a passion for food, and is constantly on a trip to
    new lands, in pursuit of the best flavours, tricks, ingredients and recipes from
    all over the world.



    He travels light with just a walking stick, an all-purpose
    knife, his bag of cooking tools. His travel companion and trusted friend is a
    Phoenix chick that he found in one of his early trips, which has taken home inside
    his portable lantern.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -5592514773993622969, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6,
    type: 2}
