  m_text: 'Hamlet can walk, run, jump, talk to other characters, collect items and
    take part in fights which require swinging his walking stick, getting hit and
    fainting. In addition to that he has a couple of tools that presented some interesting
    cases for animation, like his walking cane or the lantern that he carries around
    on his back which houses his companion, the phoenix chick.             '
