      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\tThe story still needs a contestant who is considered by the community
    to be this year's top favorite to win. As Hamlet wanders around town he is going
    to hear a lot of gossip about them and the groundbreaking new dish they are preparing
    that everyone is eager to try. That contestant is going to be of interest to
    Comb himself, setting themselves clearly apart from the rest of the contestants,
    evoking jealousy and admiration around their name.\n\tThat character, is going
    to become a \"bait\" for the players who could totally try to approach them and
    either copy or even go as far as to steal the recipe they are preparing, with
    the equivalent narrative complications. "
