  m_text: 'Maqam is a dedicated bard that hangs around on the island in various spots,
    and will offer to entertain the protagonist with its lyrical skills.



    It
    is a secondary, friendly character that indirectly helps the Hamlet, the pig
    chef in his adventure by singing songs and poems that contain information about
    the island, its inhabitants, providing clues to make the chef''s adventure easier.'
