  m_text: "\tPresenting the Sweet Cream means that no experimentation or effort has
    been made whatsoever, since it's the simplest dish to make (tutorial dish). \n\tIt
    is also a sneaky move, since it's a recipe that is supposed to be secret and
    of personal value to Maqam who gave it to the player, never intending to use
    it in the contest."
