  m_text: "One thing to notice is that all core transition have a property HasExitTime
    set to false. \nThis is because to make the controls feel responsive, all transitions
    between idle, walking, jumping and attack need to happen as soon as the player
    presses the right control.Having this property set to false ensures that the
    transition begins right away instead of waiting for the clip to finish.\r\n\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
