      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Terra is the legendary chef's grandmother, much respected in town. She
    basically raised him up, and knows a lot about his preferences and the festival's
    value. She is the first one to give you information about the Golden Egg that
    has become extinct, the unique ingredient for so many delicious dishes of this
    island in the past. An excellent cook, she is happy to provide you with her signature
    recipe, the famous Pepper Cake that raised many generations, to enrich your travelling
    cooking book. She also gives you a hint about Comb (the judge) who always had
    a preference towards spicy food. All she asks is some Klipper eggs from the Mountain
    in return, as she is too old to go there.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
