  m_text: "To present a winning dish, means that other dishes - that will lead into
    failure-  can be made. \nIn this vertical slice of a game, we would like the
    players to end up with at least 2 dishes to choose to make, and an optional third
    that might - or might not- come across to our players, depending on their gameplay.
    \n\tAs the player tries to figure out the winning dish, we\n"
