      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The island''s inhabitants. One thing they all have in common: they love
    eating and cooking.



    The town has strong cooking traditions, and plenty
    of amazing local recipes. It is common for the townsfolk to be more than decent
    cooks, and they are generally pretty knowledgeable about plants, berries, spices,
    and all of the potential ingredients that grow around the island.


    Throughout
    the gameplay, their main role is to help but also mislead Hamlet with ingredients
    and dishes he could make with gossip and unfiltered information whether on purpose
    or not, that might or might not help Hamlet, serving the greatest part of the
    narrative puzzle delivery.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
