  m_text: "\tOn a personal level: Characters can reveal personal recollections of
    dishes in order for our protagonist to figure out what they like.\n\tOn a collective
    level: The whole festival and town is basically a ground for the player to understand
    their culture and what kind of dishes are popular in this festival."
