  m_text: "As our story resolves, we thought it could be fun to close drawing a 
    correlation: \nJust like the Legendary Chef is going to judge Hamlet's dish,
    so are we (the designers) going to judge our players' gameplay! \nYes, Gordon
    Ramsay style. What, you thought this was a childrens game?"
